texts.en:
Another altar, burning hot. A {item:charm_sun} lies by the fire.

Take it and put it in your bag, and you follow {faith:sun} instead. The lines tied to {faith:brute} turn grey (dormant), and the emblem in the top bar becomes the one for {faith:sun}. {b}Each god keeps its own Faith. You lose nothing.{/b}

Want to switch back? {b}Right-click{/b} the {item:charm_brute} (or pick it up and put it down again). The last Anchor you put down is the one that counts. Switching gods costs nothing.
